Schedule "H"-Canadian National Railways-
(1)	Statement of operating revenue paid in labour;
(2)	Ratio of expenses to gross earnings;
(3)	Distribution of operating expenses;	.	, ,,
(4)	Grand Trunk and C.V. Railways; disbursal of expenditure dollar and disbursal of revenue dollar.
Schedule "I"-Train mileage-
(1)	Canadian National Railways;
(2)	Grand Trunk, including C.V. Railways.
Schedule ".)"-Equipment statements-
(1)	Canadian National Railways;
(2)	Grand Trunk Railway, including C.V.;
(3)	New equipment ordered to date, 1923.
Appendix "K"-Revenue tonnage by commodities, Grand Trunk System and C.\ .Appendix "L"-Grand Trunk Railway System, including C.V.-
(1)	Operated road mileage;
(2)	Summary of additions and betterments during 1922.
Appendix "M"-Canadian National Railways-
(1)	Details of betterments effected during 1922;	_
(2)	Statement of work done on construction of new lines during 1922.
Note: Italicized figures mean deficit, credit, or decrease in all cases.
